# Shared by the images built from the repository root (keycloak/Dockerfile, deploy/*/Dockerfile):
# only what they COPY is sent to the Docker daemon. No private key belongs here: keycloak/Dockerfile
# imports the certificate alone, and the key pair Keycloak serves TLS with is mounted at run time.
*
!certs/*.crt
!keycloak/themes/
!deploy/
!frontend/angular/dist/
!backend/gateway/target/*.jar
!backend/hururaa-api/target/*.jar
